  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 4513,
  "text_len": 10
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:011AF",
  "jp": "ユミール「私、昔からこういうの苦手なの。{nl}　不器用なのね、きっと」",
  "off": 4527,
  "len": 44,
  "en": "Ymir: I've always been bad at this sort of thing. I suppose I'm just clumsy.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 4529,
  "text_len": 41
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:011DE",
  "jp": "シスク「いいえ、そんなことありません。{nl}　ユミールさんは筋はいいんですから、{nl}　練習あるのみです！」",
  "off": 4574,
  "len": 58,
  "en": "Sisk: No, not at all. You have a good knack for it, Ymir-san. All you need is practice!",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 4576,
  "text_len": 55
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:01226",
  "jp": "ユミール「そ、そう‥‥？」",
  "off": 4646,
  "len": 20,
  "en": "Ymir: R-really...?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 4648,
  "text_len": 17
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:0123D",
  "jp": "シスク「そうです。たとえ皮をむくと元の1／3以下に{nl}　なろうとも、自分の指を切る可能性の方が高くても、{nl}　味つけに難があっても、大丈夫！」",
  "off": 4669,
  "len": 92,
  "en": "Sisk: That's right. Even if peeling leaves less than a third of the original, even if you're more likely to cut your own fingers, even if the seasoning has its problems... it'll be fine!",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 4671,
  "text_len": 89
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:0129C",
  "jp": "トウヤ「そ、そんななのか？」",
  "off": 4764,
  "len": 18,
  "en": "Touya: I-is it that bad?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 4766,
  "text_len": 15
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:012B1",
  "jp": "ユミール「‥‥ええ」",
  "off": 4785,
  "len": 16,
  "en": "Ymir: ...Yes.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 4787,
  "text_len": 13
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:012C4",
  "jp": "シスク「女の子だから料理ぐらいできて当り前とかいう{nl}　考えは賛成できないけど、料理を作ってみたいと思う{nl}　気持ちは大切だと思います。{nl}　特にそれが好きな人の為ならなおさら‥‥あぁ、思えば{nl}　あたしが調理師の資格をとったのは殿下に手料理を{nl}　食べてもらいたかったから‥‥{nl}　だ・か・ら！　ユミールさんの気持ちはよくわかります！{nl}　あたしに任せてください！{nl}　きっと一人前の料理人に育て上げてみせます！」",
  "off": 4804,
  "len": 257,
  "en": "Sisk: I can't agree with the idea that a girl should naturally know how to cook, but I do think wanting to try cooking is an important feeling. Especially when it's for someone you love... Ahh, come to think of it, I got my cooking license because I wanted His Highness to eat my home cooking... So! I understand exactly how you feel, Ymir-san! Leave it to me! I'll make a proper chef out of you, I promise!",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 4806,
  "text_len": 254
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:013DA",
  "jp": "ユミール「い、いえ、そこまでは別に‥‥」",
  "off": 5082,
  "len": 27,
  "en": "Ymir: N-no, I don't need to go that far...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 5084,
  "text_len": 24
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:013F8",
  "jp": "シスク「ダメです！　中途半端は一番いけないことです！{nl}　さぁ、特訓の開始です！」",
  "off": 5112,
  "len": 56,
  "en": "Sisk: No! Doing things halfway is the worst thing you can do! Now, let the special training begin!",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 5114,
  "text_len": 53
 },
