  "id": "sce402:019EB",
  "jp": "ガボン「おお、トウヤとヤマトじゃねぇか。どうした？」",
  "off": 6635,
  "len": 30,
  "en": "Gabon: Oh, if it ain't Touya and Yamato. What's up?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6637,
  "text_len": 27
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:01A0C",
  "jp": "トウヤ「あんたこそどうしたんだ？」",
  "off": 6668,
  "len": 21,
  "en": "Touya: What're YOU doing here?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6670,
  "text_len": 18
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:01A24",
  "jp": "ガボン「俺は酒を取りにきただけだ」",
  "off": 6692,
  "len": 23,
  "en": "Gabon: I just came to get some booze.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6694,
  "text_len": 20
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:01A3E",
  "jp": "ヤマト「酒って、ここミヤスコの部屋よ？」",
  "off": 6718,
  "len": 27,
  "en": "Yamato: Booze? This is Miyasco's room, you know?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6720,
  "text_len": 24
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:01A5C",
  "jp": "ガボン「情けねぇ話だが、ミヤスコの奴に酒を{nl}　管理されててな。こうして自己申請してもらわねぇと{nl}　飲めねぇんだ」",
  "off": 6748,
  "len": 70,
  "en": "Gabon: It's a sorry state of affairs, but Miyasco's in charge of my liquor. I can't drink unless I come and file a request like this.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6750,
  "text_len": 67
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:01AA5",
  "jp": "ヤマト「ニャるほど。それは情けニャいわね」",
  "off": 6821,
  "len": 25,
  "en": "Yamato: I see. That IS a sorry state, nya.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6823,
  "text_len": 22
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:01AC1",
  "jp": "ガボン「まぁ、な。お前らもミヤスコに用か？」",
  "off": 6849,
  "len": 28,
  "en": "Gabon: Well, yeah. You two here to see Miyasco too?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6851,
  "text_len": 25
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:01AE0",
  "jp": "トウヤ「ああ、ちょっとな」",
  "off": 6880,
  "len": 16,
  "en": "Touya: Yeah, sort of.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6882,
  "text_len": 13
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:01AF3",
  "jp": "ガボン「そうか‥‥おーい、ミヤスコ、入るぞ！」",
  "off": 6899,
  "len": 31,
  "en": "Gabon: That so... Hey, Miyasco, I'm comin' in!",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6901,
  "text_len": 28
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:01B15",
  "jp": "ヤマト「あっ、勝手に‥‥」",
  "off": 6933,
  "len": 20,
  "en": "Yamato: Ah, you can't just...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6935,
  "text_len": 17
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:01B65",
  "jp": "ミヤスコ「え？」",
