  "len": 14,
  "en": "Gabon: Ah...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 7030,
  "text_len": 11
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:01B85",
  "jp": "トウヤ「うわっ！　‥‥？」",
  "off": 7045,
  "len": 20,
  "en": "Touya: Whoa! ...?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 7047,
  "text_len": 17
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:01BA5",
  "jp": "トウヤ「なんだあれ‥‥？」",
  "off": 7077,
  "len": 19,
  "en": "Touya: What was that...?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 7079,
  "text_len": 16
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:01BBD",
  "jp": "ミヤスコ「きゃぁぁぁぁぁぁぁぁぁぁぁっ‼」",
  "off": 7101,
  "len": 25,
  "en": "Miyasco: Kyaaaaaaaaaaaaah!!",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 7103,
  "text_len": 22
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:01BD9",
  "jp": "ガボン「お、おい、撤退だっ！」",
  "off": 7129,
  "len": 21,
  "en": "Gabon: H-hey, retreat!",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 7131,
  "text_len": 18
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:01BF1",
  "jp": "トウヤ「お、おう！」",
  "off": 7153,
  "len": 14,
  "en": "Touya: Y-yeah!",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 7155,
  "text_len": 11
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:01C18",
  "jp": "ヤマト「まったく‥‥ガボンのせいであたし達まで{nl}　共犯者よ⁈」",
  "off": 7192,
  "len": 41,
  "en": "Yamato: Honestly... Thanks to you, Gabon, we're accomplices too, nyow!?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 7194,
  "text_len": 38
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:01C44",
  "jp": "ガボン「だったら入らなければいいだろうが」",
  "off": 7236,
  "len": 25,
  "en": "Gabon: Then you shouldn't have come in.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 7238,
  "text_len": 22
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:01C60",
  "jp": "トウヤ「とにかくちゃんとミヤスコに謝ることが先決だ」",
  "off": 7264,
  "len": 32,
  "en": "Touya: Anyway, first thing's to apologize to Miyasco properly.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 7266,
  "text_len": 29
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:01C83",
  "jp": "ヤマト「それもそうよね。{nl}　ガボンはしばらくお酒禁止ね」",
