  "len": 59,
  "en": "Gabon: Ha, hahaha... About earlier, uh... Sorry. It wasn't on purpose, y'hear? It was Touya who...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 7417,
  "text_len": 56
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:01D35",
  "jp": "トウヤ「おい！」",
  "off": 7477,
  "len": 12,
  "en": "Touya: Hey!",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 7479,
  "text_len": 9
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:01D44",
  "jp": "ミヤスコ「‥‥」",
  "off": 7492,
  "len": 13,
  "en": "Miyasco: ...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 7494,
  "text_len": 10
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:01D54",
  "jp": "ガボン「ま、まぁ、お前も大人だし、あれぐらいで{nl}　怒ったりしないよな？　酒禁止なんか‥‥」",
  "off": 7508,
  "len": 58,
  "en": "Gabon: W-well, you're a grown-up, so you wouldn't get mad over something like that, right? Like banning my booze or...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 7510,
  "text_len": 55
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:01D91",
  "jp": "ミヤスコ「え？　見てないのですか‥‥？」",
  "off": 7569,
  "len": 28,
  "en": "Miyasco: Huh? You didn't see...?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 7571,
  "text_len": 25
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:01DB0",
  "jp": "ガボン「なにがだ？」",
  "off": 7600,
