  "len": 35,
  "en": "Miyasco: I-is that... so. No, it's nothing.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 7619,
  "text_len": 32
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:01DE7",
  "jp": "ガボン「ほら、お前も謝れ」",
  "off": 7655,
  "len": 18,
  "en": "Gabon: C'mon, you apologize too.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 7657,
  "text_len": 15
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:01DFC",
  "jp": "トウヤ「あ、ああ‥‥すまねぇ」",
  "off": 7676,
  "len": 20,
  "en": "Touya: Y-yeah... Sorry.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 7678,
  "text_len": 17
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:01E13",
  "jp": "ミヤスコ「いいえ。鍵をかけなかった私も悪いですし。{nl}　今回はお互い様ということにしましょうか」",
  "off": 7699,
  "len": 57,
  "en": "Miyasco: No. It was my fault too for not locking the door. Let's call it even this time.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 7701,
  "text_len": 54
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:01E4F",
  "jp": "ガボン「さすがだな。器量よしだぜ」",
  "off": 7759,
  "len": 22,
  "en": "Gabon: That's my girl. Big-hearted as ever.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 7761,
  "text_len": 19
 },
 {
  "id": "sce402:01E68",
  "jp": "ミヤスコ「‥‥でも、先生はしばらくお酒は禁止です」",
